{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY - In Our Parlor tells the story of a game developer who falls asleep at home and dreams about the game world they're creating. To end the nightmare and wake up, they must make their way through their own creation and reach the parlor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE EXPERIENCE - Atmospheric horror and realistic set pieces make this horror walking simulator an immersive and terrifying experience. The surreal settings and music drive this mysterious narrative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAMEPLAY - Using only the light of a lantern, navigate a series of dark set pieces and follow the music to discover the path forward. The player must make their way through a mysterious manor to unfold the story, find the parlor, and escape this nightmare. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103700?t=1761680722","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103700/5b5938c1c9938cf3950dbbb783a3bf5cee4f99f1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761680722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103700/c8d5652680fe06783011dc9397eb0cf8d2dab03f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761680722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103700/c8d5652680fe06783011dc9397eb0cf8d2dab03f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761680722","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY - In Our Parlor tells the story of a game developer who falls asleep at home and dreams about the game world they're creating. To end the nightmare and wake up, they must make their way through their own creation and reach the parlor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE EXPERIENCE - Atmospheric horror and realistic set pieces make this horror walking simulator an immersive and terrifying experience. The surreal settings and music drive this mysterious narrative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAMEPLAY - Using only the light of a lantern, navigate a series of dark set pieces and follow the music to discover the path forward. The player must make their way through a mysterious manor to unfold the story, find the parlor, and escape this nightmare. </p>","developers":["Justin Wootten"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103700/8d69c02643e54845112a88b92b9bf46a6a25c9f3/header.jpg?t=1761680722","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4103700/999408087/792b6756ce6de06d37ba9770fcf5148ddbf2f6f7/1760739487/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761157413","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4103700/999408087/792b6756ce6de06d37ba9770fcf5148ddbf2f6f7/1760739487/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761157413","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4103700/999408087/792b6756ce6de06d37ba9770fcf5148ddbf2f6f7/1760739487/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761157413","id":257219443,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219443/movie480.mp4?t=1761157413","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219443/movie_max.mp4?t=1761157413"},"name":"In Our Parlor","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219443/c3e0951113dcad26681ce7397f0d5